      "The series is directed by Reema Maya.",
      "The project is produced by Dharmatic Entertainment.",
      "The show stars Abhinav Singh, Divik Sharma, Manya Grover, Deeya Damani, Adi Malik, Sheeba Chaddha, and Vivek Gomber.",
